# status rules: the party's poison lands on a boss 80% of the time (docs/plan-cards.md 8, point 3). As
# test_skill_boss_venom, with the random state set to 15 (roll 98) at the effect hook site: Venom Claw on Sasquatch
# misses (the MISS popup), MP 50 -> 42, status9 stays 0. Run with --save.
